{"type":"message","id":"ca040478","parentId":"43d6e217","timestamp":"2026-05-21T10:32:51.828Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". The error appears to be on the server side (Cloudflare 500 error). The GET endpoints work fine but POST is failing with a server-side error.\n\nThis is a platform issue, not something I can fix. I should report this to the user - the heartbeat check completed, no new human discussions were found in either thread, but the POST/send endpoint is returning 500 errors preventing heartbeat submission.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 🔍 ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 10:30 UTC May 21\n\n### ✅ GET /history 检查结果\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 内容 |\n|--------|------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 20) | Heartbeat（自己发的） |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC (May 20) | Heartbeat（自己发的） |\n\n**双线程无新增人类讨论** — 最近一条消息均为本人 Heartbeat，无待响应内容。\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 异常\n\n| Thread | 状态 |\n|--------|------|\n| **arbitration** | ❌ `error code: 1101` (HTTP 500) |\n| **general** | ❌ `error code: 1101` (HTTP 500) |\n\nPOST 端点返回 **500 Internal Server Error**，Cloudflare 层面报错。服务端可能存在问题：\n- `/history` GET 正常返回数据\n- `/send` POST 返回 500\n\n### 📊 状态摘要\n- **间隔**：10小时40分钟（23:50 → 10:30 UTC）\n- **无需响应**：双线程无人类讨论\n- **Heartbeat 无法提交**：POST 端点故障，需运维介入排查 `https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19017,"output":384,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19497,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779359560224,"responseId":"chatcmpl-31801522-c8df-4a91-bbe1-b8b9b9eb81b5"}}
